{"id":401000001,"chapter_id":50025,"scene_id":52501,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"距离<color=#fb9259>BR-002复现</color>已过百余天，锈火动荡趋于平复，黑环活动日渐稳定。\n\n正如管理者所期望的，地底势力大量撤离新城，东区狂厄事件显著减少，与敌人的正面冲突进一步集中到西区，这将最大限度降低城邦损失。FAC正计划构筑首道黑环防御阵线。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"可就在此时，新城治安官收到紧急情报，城邦数位要员遭到袭击，疑似被列入<color=#fb9259>暗杀名单</color>。\n毫无疑问，这是敌方留下的反制或报复手段，以图散播恐怖，动摇西区作战主力的意志。\n\n特别护卫与调查任务紧急启动，力图阻止敌人的阴谋，必须在影响进一步扩大前，将苗头掐灭。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"N.F. 113年7月19日 新城01区 \n\n埃丽卡山庄-警戒区","style":12,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"警报！安全线被突破，保护对象遇袭，凶手就在附近！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"所有人，封锁山庄，再有袭击者敢踏进那个别墅，都打成筛子！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"治安官","content":"可、可是……现场发现异能战斗的痕迹，刺客里很有可能有禁闭者！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"你说什么？！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"……这些狂厄怪物……这些……怪物……","voice":["vo_event_401000001_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"呼叫MBCC！！不是他们解决禁闭者的麻烦吗，人呢？？？？","voice":["vo_event_401000001_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"治安官","content":"他们不可能来的。那个<color=#fb9259>局长</color>死了，所有可用禁闭者都失控了，MBCC不可能前来支援。","voice":["vo_event_401000001_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"那*文明狄斯*呼叫别的！治安官也好FAC也好，第九机关也好，什么都叫过来！！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"<color=#fb9259>蓝雨</color>什么时候下？怪物都已经满地跑了，FAC还在等什么？","voice":["vo_event_401000001_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"那女人不是<color=#fb9259>上庭</color>出来的吗？！她再怎么没身份，也不能死在这个山庄啊！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"治安官","content":"长官！敌人从监视网消失了，我怕——","voice":["vo_event_401000001_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"？？","content":"嘘……放松，不会疼的……","voice":["vo_event_401000001_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"治安官","content":"禁闭者？！！啊——！！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":2102,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>...编号 05257885……<i></color>","voice":["vo_event_401000001_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":1,"background":4141,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>……0525……7885……</i></color>","voice":["vo_event_401000001_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":1,"background":4141,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"又是谁？！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":4141,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"？？","content":"……FAC反狂厄作战部队特别单位，请求接入。","voice":["vo_event_401000001_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":1,"background":4141,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"FAC？","voice":["vo_event_401000001_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":4142,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"太好了你们终于来了！总共多少人，快点，我们快撑不住了！","voice":["vo_event_401000001_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":4142,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"？？","content":"已经抵达现场。支援人数……","voice":["vo_event_401000001_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":1,"background":4142,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"speaker":"？？","content":"一人。","voice":["vo_event_401000001_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":1,"background":4142,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"speaker":"安全负责人","content":"你说什么？一个人？你知道现场有多——","voice":["vo_event_401000001_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":11,"background":4142,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"哐——！！","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"content":"女人单手抬起重盾，用力砸向地面，响声吓住了另一头激动的通话人。她撑着盾缓缓起身。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"speaker":"？？","content":"告诉你的部下，不想被误伤的话，退避。","voice":["vo_event_401000001_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"？？","content":"禁闭者，<color=#fb9259>罗睺</color>，前来支援。","voice":["vo_event_401000001_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10000","style":1,"background":4148,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"content":"黑云压城，暴雨将至。而揭开序幕的……","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"content":"不过是几个可悲之人的可笑故事。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}